115-001460"><p>Data are mean &#x000b1; SD of three independent measurements, which represent fold change on log<sub>2</sub> scale compared with data obtained from control group.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t4-ehp0115-001460" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Demographics of study subjects in the first experiment.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th colspan="2" align="center" rowspan="1">Residents in<hr/></th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Characteristics</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Old apartment</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">New apartment</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>p</italic>-Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No. of subjects</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">109</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">No. of smokers (%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2 (10)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">27 (24.8)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age (years)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21.5 &#x000b1; 2.1</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28.6 &#x000b1; 16.4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.0532</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Duration of residence (days)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">87.0 &#x000b1; 3.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">41.2 &#x000b1; 13.0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c; 0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">TZCA concentration (mg/g creatinine)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.097 &#x000b1; 0.040</td><td align="cent